  "title": "Quotient & Remainder — signed xneg7 yneg3",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Quotient & Remainder — signed xneg7 yneg3",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "q=floor(x/y), r=x-y*q. Les identifiants persistés historiques sont conservés: quotient est la sortie R (reste), remainder est la sortie IQ (quotient entier). Les libellés expliquent ce décalage sans casser les fils existants.\nEntrées : x (i32) = -7; y (i32) = -3.\nRésultats attendus : quotient (i32) = -1; remainder (i32) = 2.\n\nFloor quotient q=floor(x/y), remainder r=x-y*q in the promoted numeric structure.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: explicit private Simulation; not a compiled-native claim.\nExpected:\noutput-quotient (i32) = -1\noutput-remainder (i32) = 2\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "explicit-private-simulation", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
  },
